Desk Hub
--------
https://github.com/zacharyinserra/deskhub
Based on commit b78c505279a50f80cd40bfc86f0d9de9ac79437c.

The wire protocol, the board's connection rules, the Graphite colours and the
layout of the pages were taken from Desk Hub's firmware and companion. The
companion itself is not included; it is used unmodified from the project above.
